 Build the Category Model

Before writing any code, I want you to understand why each field exists. In enterprise projects, every field serves a purpose.

Field	Why do we need it?
id	Unique identifier for each category (Django creates this automatically).
name	The category name (e.g., Electronics, Fashion).
slug	A URL-friendly unique version of the name, useful for SEO and clean URLs.
description	Gives more information about the category.
image	Displays a representative image for the category.
is_active	Lets us hide a category without deleting it.
created_at	Records when the category was created.
updated_at	Records the last modification time.
